  "description": "Removal of moss and lichen growth from roof coverings and elevations.  ú Replacement of broken roof slates with like for like roofing materials.  ú Repairs to defective asphalt, felt and lead lined roofs and box gutters.  ú Clearing / overhauling rainwater goods and soil vent pipes.  ú Cleaning and redecoration of ornate moulded balustrading.  ú Cleaning and repairs to concrete copings.  ú Cleaning, repairs and decorations to concrete cornices, plinths and window ledges.  ú Repairs / replacement of glazed rooflights.  ú Strictly localised repairs only and decorating defective timber framed doors (including frames,ironmongery, putty and glazing).  ú Strictly localised repairs only and decorating defective timber framed windows (including frames,ironmongery, cills, rollers, putty, chords and glazing).  ú Cleaning and decorations to concrete colonnade columns.  ú Repairs to defective render in basement lightwells.  ú Cleaning and repairs to stone pavers in colonnades.  ú Cleaning and decoration to railings enclosing basement lightwells.  ú Repairs and repointing of brickwork on elevations. ú Cleaning and repairs to House entrance steps and concrete hardstanding within basement lightwells.  ú Installation of temporary welfare unit on front lawn for more than 28 days",
